                                "sense_id": "fb5f2b1c-d73a-305d-b391-34d27373526b",
                                "text": "Maisie says that Danny entered the manosphere through the realm of self-help, which Cynthia Miller-Idriss, a sociology professor at American University who specializes in extremism, says is “a great example of how radicalization works.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
